  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "裝飾本來不僅限於女子一方面的，古代氏族的社會，男子的裝飾不但極講究，且更較女子而過。",
      "output_sha256": "c28f8df9779e44c28c2022dbcda3de36c3f8243a40a8fdcbce64ed65d52b802c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "c28f8df9779e44c28c2022dbcda3de36c3f8243a40a8fdcbce64ed65d52b802c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "古代一切狩獵氏族，他們的裝飾較衣服更爲華麗，他們甘願裸體，但對於裝飾不肯忽視。",
      "output_sha256": "c96e58ad59d4f0f4ae0b92d7c6c7fc4f78cba2609362b33a2e39a1a78dd99b12",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "c96e58ad59d4f0f4ae0b92d7c6c7fc4f78cba2609362b33a2e39a1a78dd99b12",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以裝飾之於原始人，正如現在衣服之於我們一樣重要。",
      "output_sha256": "edd226516c229974d3029d2047a4bf99878e0dafa3510fbfe6714349a2dc6d73",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "edd226516c229974d3029d2047a4bf99878e0dafa3510fbfe6714349a2dc6d73",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "現在我們先講講原始人的裝飾，然後由此推知女子裝飾之由來。",
      "output_sha256": "b91919756476488c55e5afb0decffbe94052aa3a1fc40156de7b94a9b9be67ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "b91919756476488c55e5afb0decffbe94052aa3a1fc40156de7b94a9b9be67ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "原始人的裝飾有兩種，一種是固定的爲黥創文身，穿耳，穿鼻，穿脣等；一種是活動的，就是連繫在身體上暫時應用的，如帶纓，鈕子這類，他們裝飾的顏色主要的是紅色，他們身上的塗彩多半以赤色條繪飾，因爲血是紅的，紅色表示熱烈，具有高度的興奮力。",
      "output_sha256": "27a9bc38b766fa02c3dc91942220c4c67accafa442d4f0514796dd50ecdf8cf1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "27a9bc38b766fa02c3dc91942220c4c67accafa442d4f0514796dd50ecdf8cf1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "就是很多的動物，對於赤色，也和人類一樣容易感覺，有強烈的情緒的連繫。",
      "output_sha256": "b732af8c8ba33dd2ac09ae84f00b331e2279376f2745dd525621bc3f14f7670b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "b732af8c8ba33dd2ac09ae84f00b331e2279376f2745dd525621bc3f14f7670b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其次是黃色，也有相當的美感，也爲原始人所採用，再是白色和黑色，但較少採用。",
      "output_sha256": "3ba5fac9c920cfb8851c14741b34d947862712eb03b0efd407aa568f2e50da6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ba5fac9c920cfb8851c14741b34d947862712eb03b0efd407aa568f2e50da6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他們裝飾所選用的顏色，頗受他們的皮膚的顏色所影響，如白色和赤色對於黑色的澳洲人頗爲採用，他們所採用的顏色是要與他們皮膚的顏色有截然分別的。",
      "output_sha256": "7e0c00a9114787eff54c2336f5f088aef50792eca6f2d5bf40766101621d7919",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "7e0c00a9114787eff54c2336f5f088aef50792eca6f2d5bf40766101621d7919",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至於原始人對裝飾的看法，究竟是基於何種原因呢？",
      "output_sha256": "6b6c01980c1243d1708dcdeafb1e39052ba1488163f3f7934157a93925de3f96",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.476789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2dc8490ef43ac6ad54cfc8916e3f5c0b6b72ca5535447fe16f160c36db3ed5f",
        "c3f7085fcbd71eed87abeb046e2c63aff894a6a1a062d2a5b7fd4fd3e6a57b68"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6b6c01980c1243d1708dcdeafb1e39052ba1488163f3f7934157a93925de3f96",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他們為何如此重視裝飾，這涉及到他們的心理狀態。",
      "output_sha256": "c7d07f2bc48cb904fa42bc2101bb981de221ab1ff9ff008e719c939f2777617b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.400666,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "acf2cbb2a75ac8b14b6128e7711f98776beec1412dbfa43f3194988c829a8170",
        "2a7681e9c59dee152d4b7105e927e2cc27daa3f9a7b1c9674690ab810b5c411e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c7d07f2bc48cb904fa42bc2101bb981de221ab1ff9ff008e719c939f2777617b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "或許我們會對他們對裝飾的重視感到驚訝，例如在他們的裝飾中，身體上的刺青是最為痛苦的過程，使用刀具或鐵箭在肌膚上刺刻各種花紋，有些甚至全身皆是。",
      "output_sha256": "3b367fa7820b0edd588d54cef26f19cfa2482c70a39c665b92fb4da068e33047",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.467269,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2481d0112dedeb4be04d37ec7ec8ce05e9b2ae19772a4be9656741bb288bd01d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3b367fa7820b0edd588d54cef26f19cfa2482c70a39c665b92fb4da068e33047",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他們願意忍受這樣的痛苦，正是為了展現勇敢和堅韌的意志。",
      "output_sha256": "cd2bd0912a3f1ee5b6bfda7dfe706aa4327c9ab59d097d73f7bfec5c5961e0dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.467269,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2481d0112dedeb4be04d37ec7ec8ce05e9b2ae19772a4be9656741bb288bd01d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cd2bd0912a3f1ee5b6bfda7dfe706aa4327c9ab59d097d73f7bfec5c5961e0dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而這種忍受，大都是爲了裝飾美觀，極少含有其他作用。",
      "output_sha256": "fafc8b539efe4f91f2527ff5dc969becb44ac5f84e180ff48a7a22f021412844",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "fafc8b539efe4f91f2527ff5dc969becb44ac5f84e180ff48a7a22f021412844",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "年輕男女在達到特定年齡時，便會自願承受這種苦刑，並視之為榮耀。",
      "output_sha256": "4eb03e8ab80cfb2872f7011e40fb0bc3d638818c09285ee0584228ccd792524a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.433027,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eee92ec7721eec778792e5b89d93977c56d0a1166e4c6f697a768bc91cb2a00b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4eb03e8ab80cfb2872f7011e40fb0bc3d638818c09285ee0584228ccd792524a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他們認為若身上沒有刺青，將在未來的愛情中面臨困難。",
      "output_sha256": "7df6e45bc850f9ccae924102fd066726871ede7a3d00e52fba64ea397ae941a9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.370938,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "45590200694f22c03a282f46aa232ed874b111036afb499bfa9dac16c721cd50"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7df6e45bc850f9ccae924102fd066726871ede7a3d00e52fba64ea397ae941a9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至於可動的裝飾，如各類環帶等，則一方面顯示他們的勇敢與戰鬥能力，另一方面也用以吸引異性的注意，因為他們普遍以勇敢為榮。",
      "output_sha256": "a07c9b0dfad529f93c30c56ada78007bc06ee38297d34dfef78fdc446f7d0b33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.539155,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b427b0b75ac8fc3f35b07311aa2c468507265243205a931954e1fd975048bac2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a07c9b0dfad529f93c30c56ada78007bc06ee38297d34dfef78fdc446f7d0b33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "身上所佩戴的許多珍貴的裝飾物，表示他們的富有，是以勇敢奪得或獵取來的。",
      "output_sha256": "811b903c905ed064f0560858826686ad5b6b7eb19e27d09f2531c42b2210e31e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "811b903c905ed064f0560858826686ad5b6b7eb19e27d09f2531c42b2210e31e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "總之，原始人裝飾的用意，一方是引起異性愛悅，一方是引起他人的敬畏。",
      "output_sha256": "67a38ac4236978350acfdb53d75307d17e7fcd91b3e681d96dfeb18616a502ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "67a38ac4236978350acfdb53d75307d17e7fcd91b3e681d96dfeb18616a502ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "事實上，各種裝飾是兼具此兩種意義的，這實在是生存競爭中不可少和有效的工具。",
      "output_sha256": "33fecfd1e4030c93a967c77afb458ea6c9993eaed70a8dcb6c7de919d57cc0b5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "33fecfd1e4030c93a967c77afb458ea6c9993eaed70a8dcb6c7de919d57cc0b5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "由這些情形看來，在原始社會中男子的裝飾較女子講究，也是因爲原始社會的人民，沒有確定的婚姻制度，無恆久的配偶，而女子在任何情形中都有結婚的機會，男子要得到伴侶，比較困難，故必須用種種手段以滿足其慾望。",
      "output_sha256": "e67c47d54615ccc60614d34515ae63e9f05b4305415c17e9c701a7da9e9847a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "e67c47d54615ccc60614d34515ae63e9f05b4305415c17e9c701a7da9e9847a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但在文明社會中，男女關係與此完全相反，男子處處站在優越地位，社會上一切法律權利都握在男子手中，女子全居於被動地位。",
      "output_sha256": "fef5b37ed675bc3eefc35728ad2e0e3b38da76032374c9f28f8414f3f86551ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "fef5b37ed675bc3eefc35728ad2e0e3b38da76032374c9f28f8414f3f86551ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "雖然近年來有男女平等的法律，但在父權制度之下，女子仍然是受動的。",
      "output_sha256": "adc1b60b866f4c2d31dc57b741f6dfbad75fa9f7ae990ca4f9db263a954e7158",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "adc1b60b866f4c2d31dc57b741f6dfbad75fa9f7ae990ca4f9db263a954e7158",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，男子可以行動自由，女子至少要受相當的約制。",
      "output_sha256": "d2528c19334e554117ba68c4b37c7edceb90b6462f368a54ebc69eb94148a450",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2528c19334e554117ba68c4b37c7edceb90b6462f368a54ebc69eb94148a450",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在這種情況下，女性為了實現獲得伴侶的願望，也不得不透過各種手段來取悅男性，而這些手段便是裝飾。",
      "output_sha256": "d0ea49d3df07590d2a1c6c8c90c308f6cfb953f29c4bc522327376b783203301",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.504146,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d28fe1b9ae5fbd95f29bb3196b11751aecac8df7cb36eaa7fc626eb2930a5ace",
        "b2295ee6a69139fc10c675fab6ad5f8f6a3beffbbf4d82746572aedcc89952db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d0ea49d3df07590d2a1c6c8c90c308f6cfb953f29c4bc522327376b783203301",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "裝飾主要的用意，大都是一方以取悅於男性，一方足以表示自己的高貴。",
      "output_sha256": "f2b5bd8f2676d48e0c73a461ec97c3b8e2cdd46860049ccfb76777741b37cf6e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2b5bd8f2676d48e0c73a461ec97c3b8e2cdd46860049ccfb76777741b37cf6e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "面部常用白粉、紅脂、口紅及蔻丹等化妝品。",
      "output_sha256": "92d48b4f44489d95b4729a373ab3f1cdbc14a856e4fdfcf5b36dbae942b6f2b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.547941,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e7944e9cf21b8e7a9e2e34c30efb05f5fc4d8f221a517ddffdec2cfa7659bf0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "92d48b4f44489d95b4729a373ab3f1cdbc14a856e4fdfcf5b36dbae942b6f2b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "正如之前提到的，紅色是原始人主要的裝飾顏色，紅白相間的搭配特別鮮明，不僅引人注目，還能彰顯其不從事勞作的身份。",
      "output_sha256": "acce613e8b663a783c232d84cfac1c8a53ef4de4d230e5b8c1d3d20a9094ade1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.542981,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
