      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "西洋婦女臉上塗桔黃色的粉，這是表示他們的富有，因爲夏天海濱避暑爲海風吹拂臉頰成黃色。",
      "output_sha256": "93a8ab367ebb35765c9f41dbd5a8c0e9467e9b205f3424f7d0e35f6dd7ee503f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "93a8ab367ebb35765c9f41dbd5a8c0e9467e9b205f3424f7d0e35f6dd7ee503f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "白色最能凸顯臉部及身體的輪廓，原始人在夜晚的燈光和月色下，經常以白色的顏料在身體上繪製條紋，以明顯輪廓以吸引目光。",
      "output_sha256": "203bda3c8bec92b8653ddc36f8644d91e544ebcf991078c379d7dcd3d3e4e97b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.552616,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3ef46bb909f492018bdb0aeeb98c93f7b89a89cd14816d625de03388b9715b06"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "203bda3c8bec92b8653ddc36f8644d91e544ebcf991078c379d7dcd3d3e4e97b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "女性使用紅白兩色來裝飾臉部，則是因為這些顏色的鮮明對比，尤其是紅色的熱情，容易引發他人的情感共鳴。",
      "output_sha256": "6ae6d37fa02a3565f2ca9b2f812830af9b55164bf9b04f7908b6220104263dbc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.419596,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b0cc3c15e402273eb9231b3acfee53bd6ebf91dc8421e7db9506b73c3ff1fd5a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6ae6d37fa02a3565f2ca9b2f812830af9b55164bf9b04f7908b6220104263dbc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "中國少女結婚時多穿紅衣紅裙，大概不外這個意義。",
      "output_sha256": "e152044066f7c017a7e9e75ea47ecbb2c355d6a4387c7b7911cfaa04b81a19c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "e152044066f7c017a7e9e75ea47ecbb2c355d6a4387c7b7911cfaa04b81a19c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "女子裝飾亦隨社會習慣而變遷。",
      "output_sha256": "3cb13bfebf14ced4dddbe966fa6ea70936ae2ae32d8f64245cc8d2d7a0d998c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "3cb13bfebf14ced4dddbe966fa6ea70936ae2ae32d8f64245cc8d2d7a0d998c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "昔人的觀念，以柔弱嬌小爲美，故女子束腰裹腳之風盛行，有“楚王好細腰，宮中多餓死”者的慘事。",
      "output_sha256": "27d30458f5f7fa8d36930f7a63757bedcabdf12680feb4fc5cc2e5c9db538ca8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "27d30458f5f7fa8d36930f7a63757bedcabdf12680feb4fc5cc2e5c9db538ca8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "近來體育發達，國人觀念改變，重健康，好運動，女子以體格壯健膚色紅黑爲美。",
      "output_sha256": "0538075ba15b87c633ec2357048a6aa4d794ff46cf1e706434d7bc0f9bfd146d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "0538075ba15b87c633ec2357048a6aa4d794ff46cf1e706434d7bc0f9bfd146d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "現在一班新進的女子，大都不飾脂粉，以太陽光下的紅黑色膚色的天然風致爲美了。",
      "output_sha256": "32158f8fbcad166a398d0066625f99f55d5679546d97768af7839fc0a8d7326f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "32158f8fbcad166a398d0066625f99f55d5679546d97768af7839fc0a8d7326f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "黑色太陽鏡之盛行，不外表示其常常外出的習慣而已。",
      "output_sha256": "a21ff2bf5f51adc0e5ddfd524282026dadf1d05eb4f6b966f020afd5e1f45632",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
